  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Maintenance\n\nThe publish workflow passes the release body straight to the markdown converter (#391, closes #388). The copy through $GITHUB\\_OUTPUT with a fixed EOF delimiter is gone, so a release body that contains a line of exactly EOF can no longer truncate the notes or fail the job. With #387, this is the first release whose notes reach the package through the file-based path, and it exercises that path end to end. No change to the generator or the runtime API.",
